    "homeType": "SINGLE_FAMILY",
    "description": "An updated Edwardian-era home in a fantastic Portola district location.  This beautifully updated partially detached home is just steps away from the vibrant San Bruno Avenue, offering easy access to shops, restaurants, and the #9 bus line for a quick commute to downtown San Francisco. This charming property features an updated Kitchen with dining area and direct access to a large deck overlooking a sunny, landscaped backyard, perfect for outdoor entertaining, three bedrooms conveniently located on one level for easy living, an inviting living room with a decorative fireplace, ideal for relaxing or hosting guests, one Full Bathroom with a shower over the whirlpool bathtub and a huge basement with ample space to create additional living space, a workshop or two car parking. Recent upgrades include refinished hardwood floors, new interior paint, new bedroom light fixtures, double-pane windows, newer roof, solar electric and updated plumbing and electrical systems. This home offers the perfect balance of historic charm and modern amenities, making it ideal for comfortable living in the sunny Portola district. Don't miss the opportunity to make this beauty your own!"
  },
